[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3043985468","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108371#issuecomment-3043985468","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108371","id":3043985468,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61b4g8","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-07T08:34:46Z","updated_at":"2025-07-07T08:48:46Z","body":"> * @Faless / @lawnjelly: We're still on mbedTLS 2.28.10 on `3.x` / `3.6`, which was the previous LTS, but is now EOL. So notably we're missing this batch of security fixes, assuming some of those affect 2.28.10. So I would suggest looking into updating mbedTLS to 3.6.4 on `3.x` and `3.6` too.\r\n\r\nFor the record, this is a minimal diff of changes to 3.6 to allow building against distro-provided mbedTLS 3.x:\r\nhttps://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/godot3/blob/rawhide/f/godot3-mbedtls3-90482.patch\r\n\r\nIn our case though we'll want to update the vendored lib too so the whole of #90482 should be cherry-picked (the `thirdparty` changes might conflict due to a different base mbedTLS version, they can be redone anew with mbedTLS 3.6.4 directly).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3043985468/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3045580108","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108371#issuecomment-3045580108","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108371","id":3045580108,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61h91M","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-07T15:14:18Z","updated_at":"2025-07-07T15:14:18Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3045580108/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin